"answer": "Project Zenith is a strategic initiative that has recently secured a partnership with TechInnovate for AI research. The project team is expanding with five new members specializing in cybersecurity and cloud architecture. Key milestones include the successful completion of the testing phase and the testing of a secure file sharing prototype, with user interface enhancements planned for October. The executive board has approved a $2M budget, with the compliance plan budget increased to $55,000. The project is currently in a phase of gathering innovative ideas from R&D by July 20th, focusing on AI-enhanced data visualization. Security protocols, including multi-factor authentication and encryption, will be updated starting next January. Feedback on the prototype's performance and user experience is being sought by the end of November, and a celebration for the milestone is scheduled for October 10th."
